{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cHARMONIC REFLECTIONS\u201d\u00a0is a visual novel that unfolds through an engaging narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story follows a protagonist who has lost the sound of the piano, and whose heart wavers between two girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A youth story depicting a love triangle set in one unforgettable summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player\u2019s choices will determine which girl the protagonist ends up with,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">offering two distinct endings to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime is approximately 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please enjoy and step into the heartwarming story, accompanied by beautiful visuals and a richly diverse musical score you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/extras/ec0dd29b2e0dac16354f6f3406950c62.avif?t=1752302344\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff1cSTORY\uff1e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have memories of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So said the unknown girl who appeared before Aruto Mozumi, a third-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aruto has lost both his childhood memories and the ability to hear piano sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meanwhile, his younger brother Tokio is blessed with a natural gift for piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is it that he alone cannot hear the sound of the piano?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haunted by a vague anxiety, Aruto can't bring himself to confess his feelings to the classmate he has a crush on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final summer of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The guidance of a girl with memories of the future begins to dramatically change Aruto's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bittersweet and fleeting summer romance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782920?t=1752302344","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/4935cfe78429d4aad64a6c34a18322ed8a82e4c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752302344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/dd216ecc173346521648ac80b1783b6507430263/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752302344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/dd216ecc173346521648ac80b1783b6507430263/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752302344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cHARMONIC REFLECTIONS\u201d\u00a0is a visual novel that unfolds through an engaging narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story follows a protagonist who has lost the sound of the piano, and whose heart wavers between two girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A youth story depicting a love triangle set in one unforgettable summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player\u2019s choices will determine which girl the protagonist ends up with,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">offering two distinct endings to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime is approximately 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please enjoy and step into the heartwarming story, accompanied by beautiful visuals and a richly diverse musical score you won\u2019t forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/extras/ec0dd29b2e0dac16354f6f3406950c62.avif?t=1752302344\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\uff1cSTORY\uff1e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I have memories of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So said the unknown girl who appeared before Aruto Mozumi, a third-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aruto has lost both his childhood memories and the ability to hear piano sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meanwhile, his younger brother Tokio is blessed with a natural gift for piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is it that he alone cannot hear the sound of the piano?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haunted by a vague anxiety, Aruto can't bring himself to confess his feelings to the classmate he has a crush on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final summer of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The guidance of a girl with memories of the future begins to dramatically change Aruto's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bittersweet and fleeting summer romance.</p>","developers":["Laplacian"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782920/77a729f46bfc5439cf843de6abae9b6ad4e5965a/header.jpg?t=1752302344","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257165164,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257165164/movie480.mp4